@HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### healthcheck
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### get all projects
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

###

### get project by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{8D32E6AC-59E4-4253-82D3-82E30B88A171}
Accept: application/json
###

### get project with a different id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{00224DE4-59B5-4085-976D-97B07890FEF9}
Accept: application/json

###

### get model attributes for project 1
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{8D32E6AC-59E4-4253-82D3-82E30B88A171}/model-attributes
Accept: application/json

### get model attributes for project 2
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{00224DE4-59B5-4085-976D-97B07890FEF9}/model-attributes
Accept: application/json
###

### get cost breakdown by scope for project
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{8D32E6AC-59E4-4253-82D3-82E30B88A171}/cost-breakdown/scope
Accept: application/json

###

### Projects Overview summary
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### Projects Overview — default pagination
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/overview
Accept: application/json

###

### Analytics-ready projects
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/overview?analytics_ready=true&page=1&page_size=10&sort_by=selling_price_per_sqm&sort_order=desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Projects filtered by floor area and levels
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/overview?min_floor_area=100&max_floor_area=300&levels=2&page=1&page_size=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Invalid request — should return HTTP 422
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/overview?page=0&page_size=101&sort_by=invalid
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/analytics/benchmark/{92B51B88-C0D3-4A04-872F-E2CFD3D1929F}?floorAreaTolerancePercent=20&alertThresholdPercent=20&minimumPeers=3&matchNumberOfLevels=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Material what-if: replace a timber floor with concrete at $185/m2
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/analytics/what-if
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "8D32E6AC-59E4-4253-82D3-82E30B88A171",
  "modelId": "MODEL-REC-ID",
  "scenarioType": "floor",
  "scopeName": "Floor Structure",
  "originalMaterial": "Timber",
  "replacementMaterial": "Concrete",
  "replacementUnitRate": 185.00
}
